{"id":"214537992e13e711","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_DeltaArrow.md","title":"DeltaArrow","display":"DeltaArrow","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"DeltaArrow","parameters":["m","n","f"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"DeltaArrow"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>m</span><span>n</span><span>f</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：小拟范畴语义。有序参数：<code>m</code>、<code>n</code>、<code>f</code>。</p>\n<p>精确含义以本页公式体及其全部依赖为准。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ DeltaArrow m n f)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(and\n  (@ Nat m)\n  (and\n    (@ Nat n)\n    (exists mm\n      (exists nn\n        (and\n          (@ Succ m mm)\n          (and\n            (@ Succ n nn)\n            (and\n              (@ Map f mm nn)\n              (forall i\n                (implies\n                  (in i mm)\n                  (forall j\n                    (implies\n                      (in j mm)\n                      (implies (in i j) (exists x (exists y (and (@ App f i x) (and (@ App f j y) (or (= x y) (in x y))))))))))))))))))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8bd25e131370b9c4\" href=\"?note=8bd25e131370b9c4\" title=\"ZFC_App\">App</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b242e5082334b5f2\" href=\"?note=b242e5082334b5f2\" title=\"ZFC_Map\">Map</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e2136a636857d477\" href=\"?note=e2136a636857d477\" title=\"ZFC_Nat\">Nat</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"1d9ce9ba5108a31b\" href=\"?note=1d9ce9ba5108a31b\" title=\"ZFC_Succ\">Succ</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"证明状态\">证明状态</h2>\n<p>本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"593f9bdab4d60707\" href=\"?note=593f9bdab4d60707\" title=\"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务\">000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"规范公式","text":"规范公式","level":2},{"id":"直接依赖","text":"直接依赖","level":2},{"id":"证明状态","text":"证明状态","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"000_ZFC/01_language","status":"resolved","id":"f625c6fc1945e22e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"规范公式","excerpt":"`(@ DeltaArrow m n f)` 按 [[000_ZFC/01_language|无捕获缩写规则]] 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_App","status":"resolved","id":"8bd25e131370b9c4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_Map|Map]]；[[ZFC_Nat|Nat]]；[[ZFC_Succ|Succ]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_Map","status":"resolved","id":"b242e5082334b5f2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_Map|Map]]；[[ZFC_Nat|Nat]]；[[ZFC_Succ|Succ]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_Nat","status":"resolved","id":"e2136a636857d477","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_Map|Map]]；[[ZFC_Nat|Nat]]；[[ZFC_Succ|Succ]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_Succ","status":"resolved","id":"1d9ce9ba5108a31b","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_Map|Map]]；[[ZFC_Nat|Nat]]；[[ZFC_Succ|Succ]]","embed":false},{"target":"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务","status":"resolved","id":"593f9bdab4d60707","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"证明状态","excerpt":"本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 [[000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务]]。","embed":false}],"math":[],"bytes":1259,"backlinks":[{"id":"f8f4015d1e8911d1","anchor":"ref-3","locati